pear in slog output. Check whether any docs or log-parsing tooling list the reason values.\n- A comment on the issue shows that an earlier lead attempt failed while pushing. That was a controller problem, not a problem with this routing.\n\nRequested next: `ard:triage:engineer`\nOutput: [.ard/157/triage-lead.md](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/8d340beb75d629c6ab180d9e176e8dee3290e450/.ard/157/triage-lead.md) · log [.ard/157/logs/triage-lead-20261123T102041.543Z.log](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/8d340beb75d629c6ab180d9e176e8dee3290e450/.ard/157/logs/triage-lead-20261123T102041.543Z.log) · job `01M83YR3TH42Q4B4HHRWE6P4T5` · attempt 1\n\n\n","numLines":32,"startLine":1,"totalLines":32}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YY1riE6uPtftp1KZDZYFh2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
